Subject to this agreement, APX Labs grants you a non-exclusive,
non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable, royalty-free license to:

a. install and run Niro in object code form only for your internal business or
personal purposes, including performing security assessments of Authorized
Targets for yourself or a client;

b. make exact, unmodified copies of Niro solely for backup, operational
security, and deployment within your organization, including an internal
artifact mirror;

c. allow your employees and contractors to use those copies solely on your
behalf and subject to this agreement, provided that you remain responsible for
their compliance; and

d. reproduce the documentation internally, and copy or adapt examples and
